WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.333
- FOLKS, I'm Han Scottsen.

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:05.208
And with playoffs approaching, ANXIETY
around the league is at an all time high.

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:07.750
This is NFL DREADZONE.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.208
[Hans:] We begin in Philadelphia,

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:12.583
where everyone is freaking the f--k out.

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:15.000
- To be good or not to be good...

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:18.083
That is the.... uhhh, line?

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:19.208
- UHHHHHH.

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:21.208
- [Philly Fan 1:] It's the same plays every week!

00:00:21.208 --> 00:00:23.083
- [Philly Fan 2:] You know who can always handle the bright lights?

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:24.333
Nicky Foles!

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:25.833
[Philly Fans:] Yeah! / For sure!

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:29.083
- Just got a DREAD ALERT from Jacksonville, where the Jags are stuck in neutral. 

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:30.875
- Am I the only reason we’re this good?

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:33.583
Or am I the reason we're not good enough?

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:35.208
- [Speaker:] I asked if Pepsi was okay.

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:38.958
- So, um, do you, uh, wanna go all the way?

00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:39.625
- Don't be silly.

00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:41.958
We have to stop at the NFC Championship
game like always.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:47.083
- I worry that this might be my last shot
at greatness.

00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:50.583
You know, everybody always asks: How 'BOUT Them Cowboys.

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:53.583
But no one ever asks: How are those Cowboys? Ya know?

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:55.083
- Oh, sorry.

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:55.958
I think that's our time.

00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:58.708
- OH AND WELCOME TO THE BITCHING HOUR!

00:00:58.708 --> 00:01:01.583
Where nerves get preserved, and groans become moans.

00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:03.583
Let's start with a quad box in KC.

00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:05.625
[Toney/Rice/Valdes-Scantling/Watson:] Man, I can’t catch anything!

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.625
- [Mahomes:] JUST REEL IT IN/IT'S RIGHT THERE/COME ON, NAGY/THIS IS TAYLOR SWIFT'S FAULT.

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:13.833
- Seems like a lot of frustration for a man
who, unlike me, can pee whatever he wants.

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:17.708
- Okay, remember this year
you DON’T want to take the early exit.

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:18.375
- I KNOW.

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:20.750
What's this guy's deal?

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.583
- It's Ol' Joe, still got a little gas in my tank.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:27.625
- Let's go to a HEXABOX of all the fan
bases who think they’re cursed in the playoffs.

00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:29.875
- [All fans:] THEY LET ME DOWN EVERY YEAR.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.208
- Aw, the other fanbases think they know pain...

00:01:32.208 --> 00:01:33.708
- [Crowd:] Awww...

00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:41.791
- [Hans:] And it wouldn't be the DreadZone without a stop in Miami.

00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:44.916
- Oh god, I thought we had this all locked up.

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:49.500
- Hi. We're back.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:50.541
- [Tua, McDaniel:] AHHHH!!

